OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI repeats apology to Pat       
OL,4,AFinucane's family during inquiry       
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,7,F(PSNI) has repeated an apology over the
OL,8,Fmurder of Pat Finucane, describing it  
OL,9,Fas an act of "brutality" without       
OL,10,Fjustification.                         
OL,12,FIt was read out as part of an opening  
OL,13,Fsubmission by a lawyer for the PSNI at 
OL,14,Fthe inquiry into the solicitor's       
OL,15,Fkilling.                               
OL,17,FThe inquiry was also told the          
OL,18,Fgovernment intends as much evidence "as
OL,19,Fpossible" to be heard in public.       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
