OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI repeats apology to Pat       
OL,4,AFinucane's family during inquiry       
OL,6,FFinucane, 39, was shot at his home in  
OL,7,Fnorth Belfast by the Ulster Defence    
OL,8,FAssociation (UDA) in front of his wife 
OL,9,Fand children in February 1989.         
